@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SimSun
skinparam defaultFontSize 20
skinparam ArrowColor black
skinparam ClassBackgroundColor white
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor white
skinparam NoteBorderColor black
skinparam PackageBackgroundColor white
skinparam PackageBorderColor black
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam minClassWidth 220
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam nodesep 70
skinparam ranksep 80
hide circle
hide empty members
package "到货验收及新增合格入库" as I {
' @reference purchase_order
class "采购" as order_i <<entity>>
' @reference purchase_order_item
class "采购项目" as order_item_i <<entity>>
' @reference material_batch
class "材料批次" as batch_i <<entity>>
' @reference stock_location
class "存放位置" as location_i <<entity>>
' @reference inventory_movement
class "库存变动" as movement_i <<entity>>
class "验收" as purchase_receipt <<entity>> {
 实际到货时间、随货单依据
 验收状态、经办及确认时间
 --
 +核对已确认原采购()
 +登记本次实际到货()
 +确认验收结果(明细与依据)
}
class "验收项目" as purchase_receipt_item <<entity>> {
 到货、合格、拒收、待检数量
 批次位置、检验及差异依据
 /本次新确认合格增量
 --
 +核对到货数量分解()
 +核对材料批次位置及采购支持量()
 +确认待检后续结论(保留原到货)
 +计算本次应入库增量()
}
order_i "1" -- "0..*" purchase_receipt
purchase_receipt "1" *-- "0..*" purchase_receipt_item
order_item_i "1" -- "0..*" purchase_receipt_item
batch_i "0..1" -- "0..*" purchase_receipt_item
location_i "0..1" -- "0..*" purchase_receipt_item
purchase_receipt_item "0..1" -- "0..*" movement_i
batch_i -[hidden]right- location_i
note bottom of purchase_receipt_item
到货＝合格＋拒收＋待检；到货正，其余非负。
待检沿用原到货记录，后续只补新合格增量。
验收增量、流水与余额共同保存；拒收待检不计可领量。
合格入库后，普通领用仍须批次已放行且未过期。
end note
}
@enduml
